# Operating system
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Obsidian
# The repository root doubles as an Obsidian vault. Vault config is tracked so
# the layout is shared; only per-machine UI state is ignored.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# `**/` so these keep working wherever the vault lives.
**/.obsidian/workspace.json
**/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
**/.obsidian/cache
.trash/

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
# Explicitly tracked, in case a broad rule above ever matches them.
# uv.lock in particular MUST be committed -- it is the reproducibility contract.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
!.gitkeep
!uv.lock
!requirements-colab.txt
!reports/**/*.md
!configs/*.yaml

# Vault note attachments. Without these, the blanket image rules above would
# silently swallow any screenshot pasted into a note -- with no error, which is
# the worst way to lose a figure.
!docs/obsidian/04 Reference/attachments/**
!docs/obsidian/04 Reference/attachments/*.png
!docs/obsidian/04 Reference/attachments/*.jpg
!docs/obsidian/04 Reference/attachments/*.jpeg
!docs/obsidian/04 Reference/attachments/*.gif
!docs/obsidian/04 Reference/attachments/*.svg
